[[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238790\">7040A14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238788\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238528\">5580C22</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem follow the safety instructions for working on the system carefully\n(\n                                                               <a href=\"#/3238524\">5580C</a>\n                                                                ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>1. Disconnect integrated services control unit electrical connections\n(1a), (1b), (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Integrated services control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236885\">M40A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Integrated services control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236891\">M40B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Integrated services control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236898\">M40C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts fixing the control unt and relay mounting bracket.</p><p>3. Move the control unit and relay mounting  bracket.</p><p>4. Undo the bolts (4a) and move the dashboard bracket (4b) slightly.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018553.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,16,"<p>1. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Air distribution actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237146\">N80</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Remove the motor by disconnecting it from the engine shaft.</p><p>4. If necessary, remove the motor shaft.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018554.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the motor is undamaged.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not test motor operation by\nconnecting to the 12V supply. Once the operation is completed, test the\nsystem using an Examiner or another tester.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>1. Refit the motor shaft, if it was removed.</p><p>2. Refit the motor.</p><p>To facilitate connection of the motor shaft to the motor, reconnect\nthe electrical connection and turn the actuator by operating the\ncontrol on the facia until it is aligned with the shaft.</p><p>3. Tighten the screws.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018555.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,16,"<p>Position the dashboard bracket and tighten\nthe bolts.</p><p>Refit the control unit and relay bracket.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the control unit\nand relay holder bracket.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nintegrated services control unit.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238528\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238788\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238790\">7040A14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p>"],[2047,96,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238852\">7040L37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238342\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238792\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238501\">5560C51</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238256\">5010C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238254\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238799\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238800\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238801\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238788\">7040A09</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem follow the safety instructions for working on the system carefully.\n(\n                                                               <a href=\"#/3238524\">5580C</a>\n                                                                )</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3238528\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238460\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238502\">5560C60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238496\">5560B02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238497\">5560B03</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238476\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238789\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238346\">5040D70</a></p>"],[2047,96,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p><a href=\"#/3238346\">5040D70</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238789\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238476\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238497\">5560B03</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238496\">5560B02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238502\">5560C60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238460\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238528\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238788\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238801\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238800\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238799\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238254\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238256\">5010C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238501\">5560C51</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238792\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238342\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238852\">7040L37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p>"],[2047,127,24,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238857\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (driver&#x27;s side)</p><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Air distribution actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237146\">N80</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Remove the motor by disconnecting it from the engine shaft.</p><p>4. If necessary, remove the motor shaft.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018586.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,24,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the motor is undamaged.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not test motor operation by\nconnecting to the 12V supply. Once the operation is completed, test the\nsystem using an Examiner or another tester.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>1. Refit the motor shaft, if it was removed.</p><p>2. Refit the motor.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>To facilitate connection of the\nmotor shaft to the motor, reconnect the electrical connection and turn\nthe actuator by operating the control on the facia until it is aligned\nwith the shaft.</p></aside><p>3. Tighten the bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018587.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,24,"<p><a href=\"#/3238857\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (driver&#x27;s side)</p>"]]